{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RISE</strong> is a co-op climbing game for 1\u20138 players. Join a team of old friends and work together to scale ancient summits on majestic sky islands. Just make sure to reach the top before nightfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLIMBING CHAOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your axes, sway across beams, and launch yourself with low gravity. One wrong move? See you at the bottom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR PATH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-made routes with tough choices all the way to the top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POWER UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snack on mystery mushrooms and loot gear left by other unlucky climbers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NO TIME TO CRY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save points keep you climbing with friends - fall fast, restart faster. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op and offline solo play - up to 8 players!\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity chat + walkie talkies for long range communication\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Binoculars to scout ahead and a camera to take pictures\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock skins to customize your climber\u2019s gear\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original musical score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old People</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874450?t=1767792350","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874450/c04453365f308809b11deee435bbcf44a0fb3af4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767792350","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass